   449	    // derived from the source's ELEMENTS, on shards this transaction never declared, and a Local
   450	    // child is ordered only against the commands that share its one shard -- so an earlier MSET
   451	    // still pending on a weight key's shard would be invisible to it. As an Xshard child it can
   452	    // declare every shard as a participant and take the transaction's ordinary stage barrier.
